     <li>\n        <a href=\"/\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"&lt;front&gt;\">Annual Reports</a>\n              </li>\n          <li>\n        <a href=\"/\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"&lt;front&gt;\">FAQs</a>\n              </li>\n          <li>\n        <a href=\"/\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"&lt;front&gt;\">CSR</a>\n              </li>\n          <li>\n        <a href=\"/\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"&lt;front&gt;\">Public Notices</a>\n              </li>\n          <li>\n        <a href=\"/\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"&lt;front&gt;\">News &amp; Events</a>\n              </li>\n        </ul>\n  \n              </li>\n          <li>\n        <a href=\"/\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"&lt;front&gt;\">Get Help</a>\n                                <ul>\n              <li>\n        <a href=\"/\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"&lt;front&gt;\">Check Claim Status</a>\n              </li>\n          <li>\n        <a href=\"/\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"&lt;front&gt;\">Complaints</a>\n              </li>\n          <li>\n        <a href=\"/\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"&lt;front&gt;\">Contact Us</a>\n              </li>\n          <li>\n        <a href=\"/file%20a%20claim\">File a Claim</a>\n              </li>\n          <li>\n        <a href=\"/\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"&lt;front&gt;\">Report Corruption</a>\n              </li>\n        </ul>\n  \n              </li>\n        </ul>\n  \n\n\n  </nav>\n<div id=\"block-pcf-theme-sitebranding\">\n  \n    \n        <a href=\"/\" rel=\"home\">\n      <img src=\"/sites/default/files/pcf-logo-icon_0.png\" alt=\"Home\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n    </a>\n        <a href=\"/\" rel=\"home\">PCF</a>\n    \n</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  </header>\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main>\n    <a id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>\n    <div class=\"layout-content\">\n        <div>\n    <div data-drupal-messages-fallback class=\"hidden\"></div><article>\n\n  \n    \n\n  \n  <div>\n      <div class=\"layout layout--onecol\">\n    <div class=\"layout__region layout__region--content\">\n      <div>\n  \n    \n      \n            <div><section class=\"pcf-page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"pcf-page-hero__inner\">\n    <div class=\"pcf-page-hero__breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> / About PCF</div>\n    <h1>About PCF</h1>\n    <p>A State Corporation established to protect Kenyan policyholders and restore confidence in the insurance sector.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pcf-page-content\">\n  <div class=\"pcf-page-main\">\n    <h2>Who we are</h2>\n    <p>The Policyholders Compensation Fund (PCF) is a State Corporation under the National Treasury, established through Legal Notice No. 105 of 2004 and operational since January 2005. The Fund is governed by Section 179 of the Insurance Act (Cap 487) and the Insurance (Policyholders Compensation Fund) Regulations, 2010.</p>\n    <p>PCF was created following the collapse of several insurance companies prior to 2005, which eroded public trust in the sector. Its founding purpose remains twofold: compensating claimants of insurers placed under statutory management or liquidation, and strengthening general public confidence in Kenya\'s insurance industry.</p>\n\n    <h2>Our mandate</h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Provide compensation to policyholders of an insurer placed under statutory management or whose licence has been cancelled</li>\n      <li>Monitor, in consultation with the Commissioner of Insurance, the risk profile of licensed insurers</li>\n      <li>Advise the Cabinet Secretary for the National Treasury on matters relating to policyholder protection</li>\n      <li>Administer the statutory levy paid by insurers that pre-funds the Fund\'s compensation capacity</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>Our vision</h2>\n    <p>A trusted Fund for policyholders\' protection and compensation.</p>\n\n    <h2>Our mission</h2>\n    <p>To uphold public confidence in the insurance sector through timely compensation of claimants and prompt resolution of insurers.</p>\n\n    <h2>Governance</h2>\n    <p>PCF is governed by a Board of Trustees comprising representatives of the National Treasury, the Attorney-General\'s office, the insurance industry, insurance brokers, and an independent trustee representing the general public. Day-to-day operations are led by a Managing Trustee, who also serves as Chief Executive Officer, supported by directors overseeing Legal Services and Corporate Services.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <aside class=\"pcf-page-sidebar\">\n    <div class=\"pcf-info-box\">\n      <h3>Quick facts</h3>\n      <dl>\n        <dt>Established</dt>\n        <dd>Legal Notice No. 105 of 2004</dd>\n        <dt>Operational since</dt>\n        <dd>January 2005</dd>\n        <dt>Legal basis</dt>\n        <dd>Section 179, Insurance Act (Cap 487)</dd>\n        <dt>Oversight</dt>\n        <dd>The National Treasury</dd>\n      </dl>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pcf-cta-box\">\n      <p>Want to know more about our leadership?</p>\n      <a href=\"/board-of-trustees\" class=\"pcf-btn pcf-btn--primary\">Board of Trustees</a>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n</div></div>\n      \n  </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</article>\n\n  </div>\n\n    </div>\n    \n    \n  </main>\n\n      <footer>\n        <div>\n    <div id=\"block-pcf-theme-sitefooter\">\n  \n    \n      \n  <div>\n    <div>Body</div>\n              <div><footer class=\"pcf-footer\">\n  <div class=\"pcf-footer__inner\">\n    <div class=\"pcf-footer__col pcf-footer__col--about\">\n      <h3>Policyholders Compensation Fund</h3>\n      <p>Upholding public confidence in the insurance sector through timely compensation of claimants and prompt resolution of insurers.</p>\n      <div class=\"pcf-footer__social\">\n        <a href=\"https://facebook.com/PCFKenya\" aria-label=\"Facebook\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M22 12a10 10 0 1 0-11.6 9.9v-7H7.9V12h2.5V9.8c0-2.5 1.5-3.9 3.8-3.9 1.1 0 2.2.2 2.2.2v2.5h-1.3c-1.2 0-1.6.8-1.6 1.6V12h2.8l-.4 2.9h-2.4v7A10 10 0 0 0 22 12z\"></path></svg></a>\n        <a href=\"https://x.com/PCF_Kenya\" aria-label=\"X (Twitter)\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M18.9 2H22l-7.2 8.3L23 22h-6.6l-5.2-6.8L5.2 22H2l7.7-8.8L1.6 2h6.8l4.7 6.2L18.9 2zm-1.2 18h1.8L7.4 4H5.5l12.2 16z\"></path></svg></a>\n        <a href=\"https://linkedin.com/company/pcfkenya\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M4.98 3.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 0 5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5zM3 9h4v12H3V9zm7 0h3.8v1.7h.05c.53-1 1.83-2.05 3.77-2.05C21.5 8.65 22 11 22 14v7h-4v-6.2c0-1.48-.03-3.4-2.07-3.4-2.07 0-2.38 1.62-2.38 3.29V21h-4V9z\"></path></svg></a>\n        <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@PCFKenya\" aria-label=\"YouTube\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M23 12s0-3.5-.45-5.2a2.9 2.9 0 0 0-2-2.05C18.9 4.3 12 4.3 12 4.3s-6.9 0-8.55.45a2.9 2.9 0 0 0-2 2.05C1 8.5 1 12 1 12s0 3.5.45 5.2a2.9 2.9 0 0 0 2 2.05C5.1 19.7 12 19.7 12 19.7s6.9 0 8.55-.45a2.9 2.9 0 0 0 2-2.05C23 15.5 23 12 23 12zM9.75 15.5v-7l6 3.5-6 3.5z\"></path></svg></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pcf-footer__col\">\n      <h4>Quick Links</h4>\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"/\">Home</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/about-pcf\">About PCF</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/what-we-do\">What We Do</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/resources\">Resources</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/faqs\">FAQs</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pcf-footer__col\">\n      <h4>Get Help</h4>\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"https://cms.pcf.go.ke/\">File a Claim</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://cms.pcf.go.ke/\">Check Claim Status</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/complaints\">Complaints</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/report-corruption\">Report Corruption</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pcf-footer__col\">\n      <h4>Contact Us</h4>\n      <address>KWFT Center, 6th Floor<br>Masaba Road, Upper Hill<br>P.O. Box 24203-00100<br>Nairobi, Kenya</address>\n      <p><a href=\"tel:+254794582700\">+254 794 582 700</a></p>\n      <p><a href=\"mailto:info@pcf.go.ke\">info@pcf.go.ke</a></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pcf-footer__bottom\">\n    <p>&copy; 2026 Policyholders Compensation Fund. All rights reserved.</p>\n    <p>A State Corporation under the National Treasury</p>\n  </div>\n</footer></div>\n          </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n    </footer>\n  \n</div>\n  </div>\n\n    \n    \n  </drupal-big-pipe-scripts-bottom-marker></drupal-big-pipe-scripts-bottom-marker></body>\n</html>\n\";s:10:\"\0*\0version\";s:3:\"1.0\";s:13:\"\0*\0statusCode\";i:200;s:13:\"\0*\0statusText\";s:2:\"OK\";s:10:\"\0*\0charset\";N;s:23:\"\0*\0cacheabilityMetadata\";O:35:\"Drupal\\Core\\Cache\\CacheableMetadata\":3:{s:16:\"\0*\0cacheContexts\";a:12:{i:0;s:8:\"url.path\";i:1;s:16:\"user.permissions\";i:2;s:14:\"session.exists\";i:3;s:21:\"cookies:big_pipe_nojs\";i:4;s:24:\"user.roles:authenticated\";i:5;s:31:\"route.name.is_layout_builder_ui\";i:6;s:8:\"url.site\";i:7;s:28:\"languages:language_interface\";i:8;s:5:\"theme\";i:9;s:8:\"timezone\";i:10;s:30:\"url.query_args:_wrapper_format\";i:11;s:29:\"route.menu_active_trails:main\";}s:12:\"\0*\0cacheTags\";a:24:{i:0;s:17:\"config:block_list\";i:1;s:15:\"block_content:7\";i:2;s:9:\"node_view\";i:3;s:6:\"node:7\";i:4;s:49:\"config:core.entity_view_display.node.page.default\";i:5;s:30:\"config:filter.format.full_html\";i:6;s:6:\"user:1\";i:7;s:18:\"config:system.site\";i:8;s:8:\"rendered\";i:9;s:13:\"http_response\";i:10;s:26:\"config:user.role.anonymous\";i:11;s:18:\"block_content_view\";i:12;s:67:\"config:core.entity_view_display.block_content.homepage_hero.default\";i:13;s:23:\"config:system.menu.main\";i:14;s:7:\"node:10\";i:15;s:7:\"node:11\";i:16;s:7:\"node:14\";i:17;s:7:\"node:12\";i:18;s:7:\"node:13\";i:19;s:6:\"node:5\";i:20;s:6:\"node:6\";i:21;s:6:\"node:4\";i:22;s:7:\"node:15\";i:23;s:7:\"node:16\";}s:14:\"\0*\0cacheMaxAge\";i:-1;}s:14:\"