al-card\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n          <span class=\"pcf-legal-card__year\">—</span>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-legal-card__info\"><h4>Feedback Template — PCF Bill</h4><span>Public participation document</span></div>\r\n          <span class=\"pcf-legal-card__action\">Download ↓</span>\r\n        </a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <aside class=\"pcf-page-sidebar\">\r\n    <div class=\"pcf-info-box\"><h3>Related</h3><dl><dt>Policies & Guidelines</dt><dd><a href=\"/policies-and-guidelines\">View policies</a></dd></dl></div>\r\n  </aside>\r\n</div>','full_html'),
('page',0,23,45,'en',0,'<section class=\"pcf-page-hero\">\r\n  <div class=\"pcf-page-hero__inner\">\r\n    <div class=\"pcf-page-hero__breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> / Resources / Annual Reports</div>\r\n    <h1>Annual Reports</h1>\r\n    <p>PCF\'s audited financial statements and annual performance reports.</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"pcf-page-content\" style=\"grid-template-columns: 1fr;\">\r\n  <div class=\"pcf-page-main\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"pcf-reports-featured\">\r\n      <div class=\"pcf-reports-featured__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"/><path d=\"M9 15l2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div>\r\n      <div class=\"pcf-reports-featured__body\">\r\n        <span class=\"pcf-reports-featured__tag\">Most recent</span>\r\n        <h3>Audit Report — Financial Year Ended June 2020</h3>\r\n        <p>The latest published audit report currently available.</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <a href=\"/sites/default/files/reports/audit-report-fy2020.pdf\" class=\"pcf-btn pcf-btn--primary\" target=\"_blank\">Download</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Browse by year</h2>\r\n    <div class=\"pcf-reports-years\" id=\"pcf-reports-years\">\r\n      <button class=\"pcf-reports-year-btn active\" data-year=\"2020\">2020</button>\r\n      <button class=\"pcf-reports-year-btn\" data-year=\"2019\">2019</button>\r\n      <button class=\"pcf-reports-year-btn\" data-year=\"2018\">2018</button>\r\n      <button class=\"pcf-reports-year-btn\" data-year=\"2017\">2017</button>\r\n      <button class=\"pcf-reports-year-btn\" data-year=\"2016\">2016</button>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"pcf-reports-panel active\" data-year=\"2020\">\r\n      <div class=\"pcf-downloads\">\r\n        <a href=\"/sites/default/files/reports/audit-report-fy2020.pdf\" class=\"pcf-download-card\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"/></svg></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__info\"><h4>Audit Report for the Financial Year Ended June 2020</h4><span>PDF document</span></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__action\">Download <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></div>\r\n        </a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"pcf-reports-panel\" data-year=\"2019\">\r\n      <div class=\"pcf-downloads\">\r\n        <a href=\"/sites/default/files/reports/audited-accounts-fy2019.pdf\" class=\"pcf-download-card\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"/></svg></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__info\"><h4>Audited Accounts for the Year Ended June 2019</h4><span>PDF document</span></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__action\">Download <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></div>\r\n        </a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"pcf-reports-panel\" data-year=\"2018\">\r\n      <div class=\"pcf-downloads\">\r\n        <a href=\"/sites/default/files/reports/audited-report-fy2018.pdf\" class=\"pcf-download-card\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"/></svg></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__info\"><h4>Audited Report for the Year Ended 2018</h4><span>PDF document</span></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__action\">Download <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></div>\r\n        </a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"pcf-reports-panel\" data-year=\"2017\">\r\n      <div class=\"pcf-downloads\">\r\n        <a href=\"/sites/default/files/reports/audited-report-fy2017.pdf\" class=\"pcf-download-card\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"/></svg></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__info\"><h4>Audited Report for the Year Ended 2017</h4><span>PDF document</span></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__action\">Download <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></div>\r\n        </a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"pcf-reports-panel\" data-year=\"2016\">\r\n      <div class=\"pcf-downloads\">\r\n        <a href=\"/sites/default/files/reports/audited-report-fy2016.pdf\" class=\"pcf-download-card\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"/></svg></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__info\"><h4>Audited Report for the Year Ended 2016</h4><span>PDF document</span></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__action\">Download <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></div>\r\n        </a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"pcf-fiscal-note\">\r\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 8v4l3 3\"/></svg>\r\n      <p>PCF\'s financial year runs from 1 July to 30 June, in line with Kenya\'s national fiscal calendar — reports are dated by the year in which the fiscal period ends.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function () {\r\n  var buttons = document.querySelectorAll(\'.pcf-reports-year-btn\');\r\n  var panels = document.querySelectorAll(\'.pcf-reports-panel\');\r\n  buttons.forEach(function (btn) {\r\n    btn.addEventListener(\'click\', function () {\r\n      buttons.forEach(function (b) { b.classList.remove(\'active\'); });\r\n      panels.forEach(function (p) { p.classList.remove(\'active\'); });\r\n      btn.classList.add(\'active\');\r\n      document.querySelector(\'.pcf-reports-panel[data-year=\"\' + btn.dataset.year + \'\"]\').classList.add(\'active\');\r\n    });\r\n  });\r\n})();\r\n</script>','full_html'),
('page',0,23,46,'en',0,'<section class=\"pcf-page-hero\">\r\n  <div class=\"pcf-page-hero__inner\">\r\n    <div class=\"pcf-page-hero__breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> / Resources / Annual Reports</div>\r\n    <h1>Annual Reports</h1>\r\n    <p>PCF\'s audited financial statements and annual performance reports.</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"pcf-page-content\" style=\"grid-template-columns: 1fr;\">\r\n  <div class=\"pcf-page-main\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"pcf-reports-featured\">\r\n      <div class=\"pcf-reports-featured__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"/><path d=\"M9 15l2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div>\r\n      <div class=\"pcf-reports-featured__body\">\r\n        <span class=\"pcf-reports-featured__tag\">Most recent</span>\r\n        <h3>Audit Report — Financial Year Ended June 2020</h3>\r\n        <p>The latest published audit report currently available.</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <a href=\"/sites/default/files/reports/audit-report-fy2020.pdf\" class=\"pcf-btn pcf-btn--primary\" target=\"_blank\">Download</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Browse by year</h2>\r\n    <div class=\"pcf-reports-years\" id=\"pcf-reports-years\">\r\n      <button class=\"pcf-reports-year-btn active\" data-year=\"2020\">2020</button>\r\n      <button class=\"pcf-reports-year-btn\" data-year=\"2019\">2019</button>\r\n      <button class=\"pcf-reports-year-btn\" data-year=\"2018\">2018</button>\r\n      <button class=\"pcf-reports-year-btn\" data-year=\"2017\">2017</button>\r\n      <button class=\"pcf-reports-year-btn\" data-year=\"2016\">2016</button>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"pcf-reports-panel active\" data-year=\"2020\">\r\n      <div class=\"pcf-downloads\">\r\n        <a href=\"/sites/default/files/reports/audit-report-fy2020.pdf\" class=\"pcf-download-card\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"/></svg></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__info\"><h4>Audit Report for the Financial Year Ended June 2020</h4><span>PDF document</span></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__action\">Download <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></div>\r\n        </a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"pcf-reports-panel\" data-year=\"2019\">\r\n      <div class=\"pcf-downloads\">\r\n        <a href=\"/sites/default/files/reports/audited-accounts-fy2019.pdf\" class=\"pcf-download-card\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"/></svg></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__info\"><h4>Audited Accounts for the Year Ended June 2019</h4><span>PDF document</span></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__action\">Download <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></div>\r\n        </a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"pcf-reports-panel\" data-year=\"2018\">\r\n      <div class=\"pcf-downloads\">\r\n        <a href=\"/sites/default/files/reports/audited-report-fy2018.pdf\" class=\"pcf-download-card\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"/></svg></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__info\"><h4>Audited Report for the Year Ended 2018</h4><span>PDF document</span></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__action\">Download <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></div>\r\n        </a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"pcf-reports-panel\" data-year=\"2017\">\r\n      <div class=\"pcf-downloads\">\r\n        <a href=\"/sites/default/files/reports/audited-report-fy2017.pdf\" class=\"pcf-download-card\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"/></svg></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__info\"><h4>Audited Report for the Year Ended 2017</h4><span>PDF document</span></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__action\">Download <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></div>\r\n        </a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"pcf-reports-panel\" data-year=\"2016\">\r\n      <div class=\"pcf-downloads\">\r\n        <a href=\"/sites/default/files/reports/audited-report-fy2016.pdf\" class=\"pcf-download-card\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v6h6\"/></svg></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__info\"><h4>Audited Report for the Year Ended 2016</h4><span>PDF document</span></div>\r\n          <div class=\"pcf-download-card__action\">Download <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></div>\r\n        </a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"pcf-fiscal-note\">\r\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 8v4l3 3\"/></svg>\r\n      <p>PCF\'s financial year runs from 1 July to 30 June, in line with Kenya\'s national fiscal calendar — reports are dated by the year in which the fiscal period ends.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n(function () {\r\n  var buttons = document.querySelectorAll(\'.pcf-reports-year-btn\');\r\n  var panels = document.querySelectorAll(\'.pcf-reports-panel\');\r\n  buttons.forEach(function (btn) {\r\n    btn.addEventListener(\'click\', function () {\r\n      buttons.forEach(function (b) { b.classList.remove(\'active\'); });\r\n      panels.forEach(function (p) { p.classList.remove(\'active\'); });\r\n      btn.classList.add(\'active\');\r\n      document.querySelector(\'.pcf-reports-panel[data-year=\"\' + btn.dataset.year + \'\"]\').classList.add(\'active\');\r\n    });\r\n  });\r\n})();\r\n</script>','full_html');
